   "url": "https://home.treasury.gov/news/press-releases/sb0540",
   "text": "The AI Innovation Series discussions reinforced that countries that deploy this technology most effectively will shape the next era of growth, and under the guidance of President Trump, America will continue to lead the way. We will continue working with the financial sector to ensure that regulatory approaches keep pace with technological developments and enable responsible AI adoption that enhances the strength of the U.S. financial system.",
